n.Uxbridge@odeonuk.com\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"302 The Chimes Shopping Centre\",\"line2\":\"\",\"city\":\"Uxbridge\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00008836\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Paw Patrol: The Dino Movie\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After their ship gets caught in a mysterious storm, the PAW Patrol pups crash land on an uncharted tropical island filled with dinosaurs. They meet Rex, a pup who has been stranded on the island for years and has become an expert in all things dino-related. When the PAW Patrol's archrival, Mayor Humdinger, begins recklessly mining in hopes of exploiting the island for its natural resources, he inadvertently causes a huge, dormant volcano to erupt. The PAW Patrol pups are thrown into a series of high-stakes, dino-sized rescues bigger than anything they've done before, as they must stop Humdinger before everything on the island goes extinct.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After their ship gets caught in a mysterious storm, the PAW Patrol pups crash land on an uncharted tropical island filled with dinosaurs. They meet Rex.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000011\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-06\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W6q8uzqfB5k\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002221\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002222\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003857\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004749\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009450\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009456\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009459\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009460\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000015584\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"00000