 road trip thinking that their band is opening for Green Day on New Year’s Eve. Inspired by Green Day’s real-life adventures...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-11\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":116,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004766\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007690\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010773\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019627\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019628\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019629\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019630\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019631\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019632\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019633\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019634\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019635\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019636\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019637\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000929\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000055\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"4c4d85ca-bbaa-49b3-8134-cb961d0d8717\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00009197\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010365\",\"eventId\":\"0000000001\",\"distributorName\":\"Trafalgar Releasing Ltd\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000004766\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Mason\",\"familyName\":\"Thames\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000007690\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Fred \",\"familyName\":\"Armisen\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000010773\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Jenna \",\"familyName\":\"Fischer\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000019627\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Angela\",\"familyName\":\"Kinsey\",\"m